  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme MAP was initiated by EngenderHealth SA, acknowledging the need for an urgent response to HIV/AIDS, linked to gender-based violence. Overall, objective of MAP programme is two-fold, viz (1) to challenge attitudes &amp; behaviours by men which compromise health &amp; safety of women/children (2)encourage men to actively involve in responding to gender-based violence and HIV/AIDS</narrative>
  </description>
